<h2>
Maternity Dresses
</h2>
<p>
Dresses are a core part of the PinkBlush range,
often in flowy, printed or solid maxi silhouettes
designed to move with a growing bump.
</p>
<h2>
Nursing &amp; Postpartum Wear
</h2>
<p>
Several styles are built with nursing access in
mind, so they can continue to be useful after
delivery, alongside other postpartum basics.
</p>
<h2>
What Should You Check Before Buying?
</h2>
<p>
Review the current sizing (many maternity brands
size differently across pregnancy stages), fabric
stretch, nursing-access details if relevant, current
price, delivery information and the return policy.
</p>
